 "stimulus_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"5\">\n  <li>Answer the following questions about <span data-math=\"x^2-4x-11=0\">x^2-4x-11=0</span>.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>Solve the equation <span data-math=\"x^2-4x-11=0\">x^2-4x-11=0</span> by completing the square. <strong>Select two</strong> exact solutions.</li>\n</ol>",
 "questions": [
