   "stem_html": "<ol type=\"a\">\n  <li><span data-math=\"x=-2+ \\sqrt{15}\">x=-2+ \\sqrt{15}</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"x=2+ \\sqrt{15}\">x=2+ \\sqrt{15}</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"x=2- \\sqrt{15}\">x=2- \\sqrt{15}</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"x=-2- \\sqrt{15}\">x=-2- \\sqrt{15}</span></li>\n</ol>",
