   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"2\" type=\"a\">\n    <li>Choose the graph that best represents the equation <span data-math=\"x^2-4x-11=0\">x^2-4x-11=0</span>.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n  </ol>\n\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n  <p><strong>Graph A</strong><img alt=\"A graph showing an upward-opening parabola on a coordinate plane with x-intercepts at (-1.873, 0) and (5.873, 0).\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"323\" src=\"exercises/media/5949a7b5bbbcba10.jpg\" width=\"250\"></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Graph B</strong><img alt=\"A coordinate plane displays an orange parabola opening downwards, with its vertex just above the origin. The x-axis includes a label '50', and the y-axis includes a label '-50', all on a grid.\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"322\" src=\"exercises/media/f076d7f78fd80e86.jpg\" width=\"250\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Graph C</strong><img alt=\"A graph of an upward-opening parabola on a grid. The x-intercepts are clearly labeled as (-5.873, 0) and (1.873, 0), showing where the curve crosses the x-axis.\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"318\" src=\"exercises/media/61788d178836c751.jpg\" width=\"250\"></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Graph D</strong><img alt=\"A graph displays a red parabola opening upwards, intersecting the x-axis at points (-1, 0) and (1, 0). The curve is symmetric about the y-axis, with its vertex at approximately (0, -0.75).\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"322\" src=\"exercises/media/ab0e2d9f5df83b89.jpg\" width=\"250\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
