   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"3\" type=\"a\">\n  <li>Are the solutions and the graph for the equation <span data-math=\"x^2-4x-11=0\">x^2-4x-11=0</span> similar?&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1332493,
     "content_html": "They are similar because the square root of a number is always positive."
    },
    {
